ontent": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le10ob03re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn10le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn10le10ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you read Sally's blog?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, she's getting really good ...\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What a life. If I won the lottery, I would definitely travel the world writing ... and eating ...  and drinking. So how is the online dating scene?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Um. Weird. I have a real psycho contacting me. SWEDEGURL. She is ... aggressive.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What do you mean?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Here take a peek.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: ... Oh my! ... OH MY! ... WOW!\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know right.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, she must really like you. She went from 0 to 60 pretty quick,  but that is a little overboard."}, {"time": "42900", "image": "engenn10le10ob03re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Way too much. I'm not that guy. This is going way too fast.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Have you met her?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, and I don't think I want to. I can't date someone like this. I would be in the hospital in a week if I dated someone like her.  I don't need someone like this. I have to date someone who is sweet and wholesome and wants to take it slow.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Didn't you put that on your profile?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, I put I am down for anything. I thought I would meet more people that way.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter! I told you you should be specific. You don't have to be picky, but you should be very clear about what you want. If I weren't specific, I would have had so many losers contacting me."}, {"time": "85900", "image": "engenn10le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What should I do?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, you don't have to date her.   If I were you, I would tell her that you are just not into those sort of things. You don't need to stay in contact with her.\n<span class=\"strong\"></br>Peter</span>: Yeah.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Also, if I were you, I'd change your pictures, they don't even look like you.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: OK. I might just take them down.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Lastly, you mustn't use your real name as your profile name. PETER 123. Change it! Now!\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ok V."}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}